WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.420
- I heard that actually was it you two,

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:05.010
you play guitar, and y'all
kept everybody entertained,

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:06.670
right, during the shoot?

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.930
- There was some music that we had,

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:11.620
but mostly it was Jeff at
the piano and people kind

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:13.920
of like joining him 'cause
he can play anything,

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.680
and it was a lot of fun, a lot of fun.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.660
- I like to play, he's a musical genius.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.180
There was a whole evening, a one man show.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:22.530
If you give him a guitar.
- [Kelly] I had no idea.

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:23.510
- Oh yeah, he's great.

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:24.956
- I know, I didn't know you played.

00:00:24.956 --> 00:00:26.430
- Yes, he is.

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:27.950
- Sings, does all kinds of stuff.

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:30.800
- And you sing, how did I miss this?

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:35.010
- I don't, when Kelly
Clarkson asks you if you sing,

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:37.248
you better be able to sing.

00:00:37.248 --> 00:00:39.240
And I can't sing.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.790
- I'm just saying, it
could be a trio moment now

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:43.439
cause I didn't know he could do that, too.

00:00:43.439 --> 00:00:45.766
(crowd cheering)
- He sings great.

00:00:45.766 --> 00:00:46.661
- I'm in, I'll do it.

00:00:46.661 --> 00:00:49.010
- And DeWanda sings,
DeWanda's a wonderful singer.

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:49.843
DeWanda sang with us.

00:00:49.843 --> 00:00:51.610
- Again, I echo what Chris just said,

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:54.325
when Kelly Clark asks if you can sing.

00:00:54.325 --> 00:00:55.158
- Everyone is backing out.

00:00:55.158 --> 00:00:57.440
Everyone is like, I'm not
going karaoking with you.

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:59.740
- I will, I'll karaoke.

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:02.860
- I love karaoke, it's so,
well obviously a whole show I

00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:05.700
started with it, but I love
it 'cause it's funny to do

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:08.510
like songs people don't
expect, so I usually rap.

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:09.700
What do you do at karaoke?

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:12.430
- Oh man, you know, it kind of
depends on how much I've been

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:14.410
what I've been drinking and
how much I've been drinking.

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:17.410
- Yes, there is a difference
between like beer and alcohol,

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:18.280
like liquor.

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:21.150
- Yeah, I'm Whitney Houston
when I'm really drunk.

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:23.650
But you know, I'm like
"Pour Some Sugar on Me"

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:24.483
when I'm just buzzed.

00:01:24.483 --> 00:01:25.903
- [Kelly] Yes, okay, okay.

